    consequence: "Dialogue can become interleaved if not carefully orchestrated",

    limitation_3: "LLM response generation is non-deterministic (same prompt => different response each time)",
    consequence: "Cannot replay agent dialogue for debugging; full audit trail compensates",

    limitation_4: "Signature validation assumes honest agent (agent could refuse to sign)",
