  final_statement: "CSTL v5.0.0 is a solid, well-engineered foundation. The roadmap to v5.1/5.2 is clear and achievable. This system is ready for production use in trusted network environments; public deployment deferred to v5.1 pending encryption/rate-limiting hardening. Strongly recommend external security audit before major production rollout."
